                                  ],
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Seasoned Java professional with 9+ years designing and building scalable, high-performance business applications — backend development, microservices architecture, and technical leadership, with a track record of improving software quality, system performance, and engineering workflows.",
